{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:12fd4f9200fac461","name":"Critical Strike","source":{"id":"source:reference-12fd4f9200fac461","title":"Critical Strike","revision":19085,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T21:17:08Z","sha256":"b5172feaa1ff85cc03045ca569b8041eef1eff0a1a133aea37d7a9cd974598c1","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19085","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Critical%20Strike&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-12fd4f9200fac461","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["At the cost of speed, you can make a devastating attack.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Base Attack Bonus"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Base_Attack_Bonus"}," +9, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Weapon Focus"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Weapon_Focus","referenceId":"reference:393613c18e211d0f"}," (Chosen Melee Weapon)\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Effect:"]}," While wielding a weapon for which you possess the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Weapon Focus"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Weapon_Focus","referenceId":"reference:393613c18e211d0f"}," feat, you can take two consecutive ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Actions"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Actions"}," in the same round to increase the critical threat range of your next ",{"tag":"a","children":["Melee Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Melee_Attack"}," by 1.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Thus, if a weapon scores a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Critical Hit"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Critical_Hit"}," on a Natural 20, it can score a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Critical Hit"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Critical_Hit"}," on a natural roll of 19 or 20 instead. However, any roll other than a Natural 20 is not considered an automatic hit; if you roll a Natural 19 and miss the target, you do not score a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Critical Hit"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Critical_Hit"},". You lose the benefits of Critical Strike if you lose ",{"tag":"a","children":["Line of Sight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Line_of_Sight","referenceId":"reference:7ae5eaf79143552f"}," to your target or if you take any other Action before making your attack.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
